WEBVTT

00:00:02.020 --> 00:00:03.640
Yano, umm...

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:08.570
You said before that there'd be no secrets between us, right?

00:00:08.570 --> 00:00:09.440
Yeah.

00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:12.240
I'll never lie to you ever again.

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:14.530
So don't lie to me either, okay?

00:00:14.530 --> 00:00:16.030
Yeah.

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:19.620
Would you tell me...

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:24.620
...what happened between you and Yamamoto-san in middle school?

00:00:27.630 --> 00:00:28.210
Yano?

00:00:31.010 --> 00:00:32.010
Why?

00:00:32.010 --> 00:00:34.010
Why what?

00:00:34.010 --> 00:00:35.760
For the same reason you have.

00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:37.090
It's making me uneasy.

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:43.180
There aren't going to be any secrets between us, right?

00:00:43.180 --> 00:00:44.310
Yano...

00:00:47.770 --> 00:00:48.690
Yano?

00:00:54.190 --> 00:00:57.530
Why won't you answer me?

00:02:37.720 --> 00:02:39.010
Ya...

00:02:49.640 --> 00:02:51.850
Would you like some more tea?

00:02:55.770 --> 00:02:58.740
Geez, knock before coming in...

00:02:58.740 --> 00:03:02.240
I completely forgot that I had received this cake recently.

00:03:02.240 --> 00:03:05.240
Come on, we're full... give us a break.

00:03:05.240 --> 00:03:06.660
My, but I went through all the trouble to...

00:03:06.660 --> 00:03:09.040
Not at all. Thank you.

00:03:09.040 --> 00:03:11.040
See?

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:14.380
I'm sorry, but could I use your bathroom for a second?

00:03:14.380 --> 00:03:17.130
Of course! It's down the stairs to your right.

00:03:22.760 --> 00:03:24.800
Talk about bad timing...

00:03:33.560 --> 00:03:35.560
Moron.

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:52.370
Ah, I'm really sorry about this... My mom just doesn't know when to back off.

00:03:52.370 --> 00:03:53.330
Don't worry about it.

00:04:00.460 --> 00:04:02.340
Should we finish where we left off?

00:04:02.340 --> 00:04:05.550
Huh? Ah... yeah.

00:04:05.550 --> 00:04:08.760
Where were we again? Oh, yeah.

00:04:08.760 --> 00:04:12.060
Before I answer, I'd first like to ask you something.

00:04:13.310 --> 00:04:17.270
What do you think happened between us?

00:04:18.520 --> 00:04:20.280
U-Umm...

00:04:20.280 --> 00:04:23.150
If you suddenly ask me like that...

00:04:23.150 --> 00:04:28.330
If you ask me that, I don't know... that's why I asked you.

00:04:29.410 --> 00:04:33.410
Yamamoto and I were in the same class all three years of middle school, and...

00:04:33.410 --> 00:04:36.290
...my seat was next to hers once.

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:41.010
Since our student numbers were close, we were the daily helpers together every once in a while.

00:04:41.010 --> 00:04:43.130
We hardly ever spoke.

00:04:43.130 --> 00:04:46.800
We never had any fights, and neither of us confessed love to each other or anything.

00:04:48.180 --> 00:04:51.310
The scale of your question's too wide that I can't answer it.

00:04:53.310 --> 00:04:54.770
Do you have any other questions?

00:04:58.520 --> 00:05:04.320
Did Yamamoto-san... love you?

00:05:06.280 --> 00:05:08.070
That's the first time I've ever heard anything like that.

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:11.790
I...

00:05:14.160 --> 00:05:15.790
During the field trip...

00:05:17.880 --> 00:05:22.090
...you touched Yamamoto-san's forehead without a single drop of hesitation, right?

00:05:25.050 --> 00:05:27.800
That's been bugging me this whole time.

00:05:32.680 --> 00:05:35.810
I might've been jealous of her the entire time...

00:05:40.060 --> 00:05:42.020
This is probably...

00:05:42.020 --> 00:05:44.780
Yano... how do you feel...

00:05:44.780 --> 00:05:46.990
...what I wanted to ask the most this whole time...

00:05:48.530 --> 00:05:50.280
...about Yamamoto-san?

00:05:50.280 --> 00:05:52.030
Who cares about her.

00:05:53.740 --> 00:05:58.460
I don't care whether Yamamoto loved or hated me.

00:05:58.460 --> 00:06:00.830
It has nothing to do with me. Not interested one bit.

00:06:00.830 --> 00:06:01.750
Hey...

00:06:03.550 --> 00:06:06.260
You know the opposite of "love" isn't hate.

00:06:09.300 --> 00:06:11.260
Then...

00:06:14.350 --> 00:06:16.180
There was nothing between you two.

00:06:16.180 --> 00:06:18.440
Of course there wasn't.

00:06:23.480 --> 00:06:24.860
Relax.

00:06:34.950 --> 00:06:37.370
I see... I...

00:06:41.710 --> 00:06:44.130
...wanted him to reassure me...

00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:49.170
...that everything would be fine.

00:06:51.430 --> 00:06:55.510
Yano I... believe you.

00:06:59.520 --> 00:07:00.600
Bye.

00:07:00.600 --> 00:07:01.690
I'll call you later tonight.

00:07:41.020 --> 00:07:42.100
I believe you.

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:50.570
I'm sorry, Takahashi...

00:07:57.990 --> 00:08:00.410
I asked Yano directly!

00:08:00.410 --> 00:08:05.460
It was just like you said, Takeuchi-kun. He said there was nothing between them.

00:08:05.460 --> 00:08:06.630
I knew it.

00:08:06.630 --> 00:08:08.920
Takahashi, you worry too much about those things.

00:08:10.920 --> 00:08:12.260
I'm glad.

00:08:12.260 --> 00:08:13.880
Yeah, me too!

00:08:13.880 --> 00:08:15.840
Thanks a lot, Takeuchi-kun!

00:08:15.840 --> 00:08:20.600
Now that I think about it, there's no way you wouldn't have noticed something happening, right?

00:08:29.480 --> 00:08:31.820
You changed your bangs.

00:08:31.820 --> 00:08:35.410
Y-Yeah, I tried splitting them. Does it look strange?

00:08:36.530 --> 00:08:38.410
You look cute.

00:08:46.170 --> 00:08:48.340
He said I look cute.

00:08:49.630 --> 00:08:51.880
Nana, did you finally do it?!

00:08:53.470 --> 00:08:56.260
Yano came to your place, didn't he?

00:08:56.260 --> 00:09:00.640
We haven't done anything yet... That's still a long way off.

00:09:00.640 --> 00:09:02.810
Yano's being forced to hold back, I see.

00:09:04.020 --> 00:09:05.810
I-Is it all that strange?

00:09:05.810 --> 00:09:09.150
No... "to each her own" is my motto. So I guess it's all right?

00:09:10.400 --> 00:09:13.690
But, but... the pressure's building up more and more every day...

00:09:14.400 --> 00:09:15.860
Why are you against it, Nana?

00:09:17.870 --> 00:09:22.490
I'm not exactly against it, I'm just not really sure how I feel about it...

00:09:22.490 --> 00:09:24.870
Unlike Yano, it's not like it's always welling up inside me all the time.

00:09:24.870 --> 00:09:27.460
So when he suggests doing it, it's a little scary, don't you think?

00:09:27.460 --> 00:09:29.460
Even if it doesn't well up in you...

00:09:29.460 --> 00:09:30.380
I totally agree with you!

00:09:31.500 --> 00:09:34.510
Nana, you don't have to push yourself to do it. Right?!

00:09:34.510 --> 00:09:36.630
You need to hurry up and get a boyfriend, too.

00:09:38.510 --> 00:09:40.970
At least, that's what Mizu-chin said, but...

00:09:43.270 --> 00:09:46.520
Moving onto question #5... Yano.

00:09:46.520 --> 00:09:47.520
Yano!

00:09:54.990 --> 00:09:55.780
Yano!

00:09:55.780 --> 00:09:56.860
Ah... yeah.

00:09:56.860 --> 00:09:58.820
You're up for question #5, part A.

00:10:00.740 --> 00:10:02.370
Question #5, question #5...

00:10:04.790 --> 00:10:12.090
She was so beautiful that I wanted to make friend with her.

00:10:12.090 --> 00:10:13.300
And the translation?

00:10:14.550 --> 00:10:23.510
She was so beautiful that... umm... I wanted to make friends with her.

00:10:23.510 --> 00:10:26.390
All right. Now replace that underline phrase with another expression that has the same meaning.

00:10:27.690 --> 00:10:29.480
Umm...

00:10:29.480 --> 00:10:36.650
She was so beautiful that I wanted to... to...

00:10:36.650 --> 00:10:40.570
Make... friends with her?

00:10:40.570 --> 00:10:42.660
Intimacy?

00:10:42.660 --> 00:10:44.370
Go out with her?

00:10:44.370 --> 00:10:49.160
"Get acquainted with..."

00:10:49.160 --> 00:10:51.540
What's this? Didn't you do the assignment?

00:10:51.540 --> 00:10:55.670
I wanted to... to... make love with her.

00:10:56.510 --> 00:11:00.130
Well... grammatically, it isn't wrong, but...

00:11:00.130 --> 00:11:01.890
Could you come up with another phrasing?

00:11:01.890 --> 00:11:03.300
Fuck her.

00:11:06.930 --> 00:11:09.390
I wonder if it all really has built up inside him...?

00:11:12.730 --> 00:11:14.440
Thanks for before.

00:11:26.240 --> 00:11:29.080
Yeah... he's really holding it in.

00:11:29.080 --> 00:11:30.120
Poor Yano.

00:11:30.120 --> 00:11:32.370
I wonder what Nana's gonna do?

00:11:32.370 --> 00:11:34.130
I'm sure she'll reach her limit sooner or later.

00:11:34.130 --> 00:11:37.630
After all, there is that story about Yano...

00:11:37.630 --> 00:11:39.470
Ah, yeah, you're talking about that, right?

00:11:39.470 --> 00:11:40.840
Does Nana know about it?

00:11:40.840 --> 00:11:42.840
I don't think so.

00:11:42.840 --> 00:11:45.510
I think we should keep it a secret...

00:11:45.510 --> 00:11:46.350
...from Nana.

00:11:55.610 --> 00:11:57.610
A story about him...?

00:12:02.400 --> 00:12:03.820
Lend me your Math textbook?

00:12:03.820 --> 00:12:07.080
Huh? At least knock first.

00:12:07.080 --> 00:12:09.790
You didn't even ring the doorbell.

00:12:09.790 --> 00:12:10.870
Ah, fine, fine.

00:12:12.160 --> 00:12:13.420
Excuse me for intruding.

00:12:13.420 --> 00:12:14.330
So where is it?

00:12:14.330 --> 00:12:15.580
It should be on the shelf over there.

00:12:15.580 --> 00:12:16.460
Unusual for you to ask, though.

00:12:16.460 --> 00:12:19.300
That girl sitting next to me wouldn't show me hers.

00:12:19.300 --> 00:12:20.550
Hey, it's not here.

00:12:20.550 --> 00:12:21.550
Ah, maybe in one of the drawers.

00:12:22.760 --> 00:12:24.430
Did you get a haircut?

00:12:24.430 --> 00:12:26.220
I just changed the mousse I use.

00:12:26.220 --> 00:12:27.810
Organize your stuff, geez.

00:12:27.810 --> 00:12:29.600
Who's sitting next to you now?

00:12:29.600 --> 00:12:30.270
Yamamoto.

00:12:32.310 --> 00:12:34.230
That must be something.

00:12:34.230 --> 00:12:35.020
What do you mean?

00:12:35.940 --> 00:12:38.980
What's up with both you and Takahashi asking about her?

00:12:38.980 --> 00:12:39.780
What do you mean?

00:12:39.780 --> 00:12:41.740
She's suspicious of me.

00:12:41.740 --> 00:12:44.280
She thinks something happened between Yamamoto and me...

00:12:44.280 --> 00:12:45.660
...when nothing like that did.

00:12:45.660 --> 00:12:46.910
Something did.

00:12:53.410 --> 00:12:55.000
I'm gonna borrow this.

00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:56.080
I saw...

00:12:57.710 --> 00:13:01.210
...you two go home together that day.

00:13:06.140 --> 00:13:09.470
Holding hands, you went over to her house, didn't you?

00:13:17.810 --> 00:13:18.980
I saw it.

00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:25.320
Incense.

00:13:25.320 --> 00:13:27.200
We went to put some up.

00:13:27.200 --> 00:13:28.990
Sorry for failing to meet your expectations.

00:13:28.990 --> 00:13:32.410
Motoharu! Don't you think you can fool me, too.

00:13:32.410 --> 00:13:33.620
It pisses me off.

00:13:36.580 --> 00:13:38.040
Why...

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:41.130
...did you pretend not to know until now?

00:13:41.710 --> 00:13:45.630
I didn't pretend not to know. You simply didn't tell me.

00:13:47.970 --> 00:13:49.640
How...

00:13:51.260 --> 00:13:53.390
...could you do it with her little sister?

00:13:56.560 --> 00:13:57.730
How...?

00:14:05.280 --> 00:14:06.150
Yano.

00:14:09.370 --> 00:14:13.240
This is... her room, isn't it?

00:14:14.240 --> 00:14:17.000
I'm using it now.

00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:20.250
The sun comes in best through here.

00:14:22.170 --> 00:14:25.260
Onee-chan's room is now over there.

00:14:30.140 --> 00:14:31.930
Though it's now the family altar room.

00:14:42.110 --> 00:14:44.980
Nana, I hear you're finally going over to Yano's today?

00:14:47.360 --> 00:14:48.490
It's not what you think.

00:14:48.490 --> 00:14:50.610
We're just going to do a report together.

00:14:50.610 --> 00:14:51.910
But his parents won't be around!

00:14:51.910 --> 00:14:52.700
No, they'll be there.

00:14:52.700 --> 00:14:53.990
If they weren't, I wouldn't go.

00:14:53.990 --> 00:14:55.160
Go for it!

00:14:55.160 --> 00:14:56.500
I'm telling you, it's not like that.

00:14:56.500 --> 00:15:00.170
Don't worry! You're his girlfriend, so have so more confidence!

00:15:04.500 --> 00:15:05.750
Ah, crap.

00:15:07.920 --> 00:15:10.760
Nana-chan, wanna get some steamed meat buns at the convenience store?

00:15:10.760 --> 00:15:12.760
I'm not hungry, so don't bother.

00:15:14.600 --> 00:15:16.390
She seems to be in a bad mood.

00:15:17.810 --> 00:15:20.480
Nana-chan. Is looking at the scenery fun?

00:15:23.060 --> 00:15:24.520
Look at me, damn it.

00:15:25.940 --> 00:15:30.030
Ah, that's the swimming school I used to go to.

00:15:30.030 --> 00:15:31.610
Oh? When was this?

00:15:31.610 --> 00:15:32.490
Till my first year of middle school.

00:15:32.490 --> 00:15:35.120
Why'd you quit?

00:15:35.120 --> 00:15:39.660
"Why?", because there was a really fast guy I could never beat.

00:15:39.660 --> 00:15:42.040
So I thought it was stupid, and quit.

00:15:42.040 --> 00:15:46.170
I see... so unless you're first, you're never satisfied?

00:15:47.710 --> 00:15:50.380
So hey... what is this?

00:15:50.380 --> 00:15:53.930
What do you mean? It's a hand. Mine, to be more specific.

00:15:53.930 --> 00:15:55.100
Does it look like a foot to you?

00:15:55.100 --> 00:15:57.890
Yano, quit the lame jokes.

00:15:57.890 --> 00:15:59.640
It tickles!

00:16:13.110 --> 00:16:15.030
They look so happy...

00:16:15.030 --> 00:16:17.830
Like they don't have a care in the world.

00:16:17.830 --> 00:16:19.750
Why do we seem to keep...

00:16:20.790 --> 00:16:24.210
...running into one problem after another?

00:16:30.340 --> 00:16:31.880
Excuse me for intruding.

00:16:37.600 --> 00:16:40.270
"Motoharu, I'm going to my doctor's appointment."

00:16:40.270 --> 00:16:43.060
"I'm going shopping after that, so I might be a little late."

00:16:43.060 --> 00:16:45.400
"Your dinner is ready and waiting in the freezer."

00:16:48.440 --> 00:16:51.030
So she's out for the day...

00:16:51.030 --> 00:16:52.490
Y-You tricked me!

00:16:52.490 --> 00:16:54.530
N-No! This is pure coincidence!

00:16:54.530 --> 00:16:55.410
You're so mean!

00:16:55.410 --> 00:16:56.570
I'm telling you, it's not what you think!

00:16:56.570 --> 00:16:59.410
You're lying! You're trying to get back at me for the other day!

00:16:59.410 --> 00:17:02.040
Are you a moron? If I was gonna do that, I would've done it fair and square!

00:17:02.040 --> 00:17:03.910
What do you mean, "If I was gonna do that"?!

00:17:03.910 --> 00:17:05.250
I'm telling you...!

00:17:05.250 --> 00:17:07.420
...in this house today?

00:17:08.500 --> 00:17:10.550
I'm telling you, it's fine.

00:17:10.550 --> 00:17:12.010
Don't make me repeat myself.

00:17:15.010 --> 00:17:17.890
So could you sit... a little closer?

00:17:17.890 --> 00:17:20.060
No... it's hot in this room.

00:17:20.060 --> 00:17:22.270
Then why don't you take off your sweater?

00:17:33.940 --> 00:17:35.450
Black tea's okay?

00:17:35.450 --> 00:17:36.860
One spoon of sugar, right?

00:17:36.860 --> 00:17:38.450
Ah, I'll help.

00:17:40.450 --> 00:17:42.660
If you trap the steam, it tastes better.

00:17:51.130 --> 00:17:53.170
What a clean kitchen...

00:17:55.300 --> 00:18:03.220
It feels kinda strange when two of us stand here like this, like we're married or something.

00:18:04.480 --> 00:18:06.310
What kind of stupid things am I thinking?

00:18:06.310 --> 00:18:07.480
I'm having a delusion!

00:18:07.480 --> 00:18:09.860
Umm...

00:18:09.860 --> 00:18:11.400
Is she feeling better?

00:18:11.400 --> 00:18:17.990
My mom and dad started going out in high school, and got married after ten years of dating.

00:18:17.990 --> 00:18:20.820
You serious? That's hard to believe. I'm surprised it lasted so long.

00:18:23.910 --> 00:18:25.700
Ah... crap.

00:18:26.540 --> 00:18:31.130
Well, I guess me and Yano getting married after going out together...

00:18:31.130 --> 00:18:35.960
...might only be the unrealistic delusion I thought it was, but...

00:18:38.930 --> 00:18:46.560
I see... the person standing here ten years from now may not be me...

00:18:56.780 --> 00:18:59.570
Sit next to me, Takahashi.

00:19:01.660 --> 00:19:06.000
The more my love for him increases, the more lonely I think I'll be...

00:19:08.710 --> 00:19:12.210
Okay, okay. I won't say anything to make you uncomfortable.

00:19:13.000 --> 00:19:15.130
I won't screw around when we're working on English.

00:19:15.130 --> 00:19:17.760
I'll hide my gum in a place where you can't see it.

00:19:17.760 --> 00:19:20.220
And I won't touch you at all today.

00:19:21.220 --> 00:19:22.930
I promise.

00:19:22.930 --> 00:19:24.220
How about it?

00:19:25.140 --> 00:19:30.440
You can't... Can you really just change your principles for one girl?

00:19:31.020 --> 00:19:36.980
I can't for my friends and other people, but for a woman, I can change them as much as necessary.

00:19:36.980 --> 00:19:38.740
Those are my principles.

00:19:38.740 --> 00:19:39.320
Get it?

00:19:42.070 --> 00:19:45.830
So, why don't you...

00:19:48.370 --> 00:19:50.830
...tell me why you're in such a bad mood today.

00:19:59.470 --> 00:20:01.260
During middle school...

00:20:01.260 --> 00:20:04.090
...is it true that you had sex with Nana-san in school gym?

00:20:07.930 --> 00:20:09.810
If it's not one thing, it's another...

00:20:11.230 --> 00:20:15.440
Like I was saying, you did, didn't you? In the gym.

00:20:15.440 --> 00:20:17.610
Ah... yeah.

00:20:20.400 --> 00:20:21.990
I don't...

00:20:24.030 --> 00:20:26.950
...intend to blame you for things in the past.

00:20:26.950 --> 00:20:29.120
Since there's nothing I can do about it.

00:20:29.120 --> 00:20:30.000
It's fine.

00:20:30.790 --> 00:20:32.250
It's fine?

00:20:32.250 --> 00:20:35.500
Even if I'm jealous of Yano's past, there's nothing I can do about it.

00:20:36.380 --> 00:20:39.090
Even ten years from now, Yano will still be the same.

00:20:39.090 --> 00:20:41.420
I should already know that...

00:20:43.510 --> 00:20:49.970
But why do I still feel I want Yano all for myself?

00:20:56.230 --> 00:20:58.020
Honestly...

00:21:00.030 --> 00:21:02.030
His hand...

00:21:05.990 --> 00:21:08.580
...didn't bug me at all.

00:21:15.420 --> 00:21:16.790
That was close, that was close.

00:21:16.790 --> 00:21:18.590
I almost touched you.

00:21:18.590 --> 00:21:23.590
It'll be hard for me to hold back if I sit close to you, so I'll sit on the side.

00:21:23.590 --> 00:21:25.680
I have to keep my promise, after all.

00:21:25.680 --> 00:21:26.680
Moron.

00:21:28.720 --> 00:21:30.680
Takahashi.

00:21:34.230 --> 00:21:37.060
I wish I could rewrite my past.

00:21:37.060 --> 00:21:38.770
But I can't.

00:21:38.770 --> 00:21:41.230
If I could, I'd do all I could...

00:21:41.230 --> 00:21:43.940
...if it would stop you from crying.

00:21:45.200 --> 00:21:48.910
But... that's impossible.

00:21:48.910 --> 00:21:50.990
My past won't change.

00:21:50.990 --> 00:21:56.920
That's why... we need to make my past pale in comparison to our present.

00:22:06.800 --> 00:22:11.760
I've always wanted... to make someone my own.

00:22:13.430 --> 00:22:15.980
I guess I say some pretty stuff now now and then, huh?

00:22:15.980 --> 00:22:17.100
Yano.

00:22:17.100 --> 00:22:19.560
I-It's fine by me...

00:22:29.240 --> 00:22:30.030
I said it--

00:22:30.030 --> 00:22:31.240
What is?

00:22:32.620 --> 00:22:34.330
Don't tell me you mean sex?

00:22:34.330 --> 00:22:36.000
Just kidding!

00:23:11.320 --> 00:23:14.280
I wonder if I'm caught in the flow of it all...?

00:23:18.370 --> 00:23:20.500
But...

00:23:24.630 --> 00:23:26.550
I don't see any reason...

00:23:28.300 --> 00:23:29.800
...to hold these feelings back.
